curl --noproxy '*' -X POST http://localhost:8889/api/task/update -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"task_id":"TI2026021192","type":"status_update","data":{"subtask_id":"S2","status":"reported","criteria_details":{"slot_pose_delta_m":0.02,"plug_pose_delta_m":0.006,"slot_stable_flag":0,"plug_stable_flag":1},"anomaly_state":{"data_commun":"abnormal","perception":"abnormal","planning":"abnormal","execution":"abnormal","plant":"unknown"},"evidence_summary":"插孔识别结果不稳定。"}}'
```

查看结构化异常建议：

